    <decisions>
        <description>2026-08-31: All Marketing Cloud mirror-field synchronization is handled in this After Save flow because Salesforce does not support the required source fields in RecordBeforeSave. Before performing DML, CHECK_MC_Fields_Need_Update compares all 24 source/target pairs. Account is updated only when at least one value differs, so the recursive After Save execution exits without another update.
2026-08-03: Update MC Fields
Moved process builder func here</description>
        <name>CHECK_MC_Fields_Need_Update</name>
